From: brkosebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 08 Nov 2026 16:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: drm: G5P render, autoboot, META71C and boot-origin policy

Carry the original-firmware G5P render/compute ABI and extraction recipe into the system kernel, with typed query/compute follow-ups and qualified WC cache handling. Start firmware at probe, install META71C 340 on every firmware image, select dirty-start mode 3 from the incoming kexec DT marker (cold mode 1), and quiet recurring diagnostics.

Integration fixups are folded into the final delta. Device observations apply
to the integration build; the isolated topic requires qualification.

Assisted-by: LLM
---

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/apple,s8003-g5p.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/apple,s8003-g5p.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..699c3492f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/apple,s8003-g5p.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
+%YAML 1.2
+---
+$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/gpu/apple,s8003-g5p.yaml#
+$schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
+title: Apple S8003 G5P GPU
+maintainers:
+  - Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
+description: |
+  G5P GPU with META firmware on S8003. The compatible is Apple's inherited
+  ADT spelling used by the qualified driver; no new vendor prefix is implied.
+properties:
+  compatible:
+    const: gpu,s8003
+  reg:
+    maxItems: 2
+  reg-names:
+    items:
+      - const: rgx
+      - const: fender
+  interrupts:
+    minItems: 5
+    maxItems: 5
+  power-domains:
+    maxItems: 1
+required: [compatible, reg, reg-names, interrupts, power-domains]
+additionalProperties: false
